  *   --section-gap apart.
+ *
+ * PER-SECTION OVERRIDE
+ * --------------------
+ * Both rules read --section-gap at the element, so you can widen or tighten
+ * one section without touching the global number. In JSX, set it with a
+ * Tailwind arbitrary property on that section:
+ *
+ *   <section className="t-section-band [--section-gap:140]">
+ *
+ * That section then uses 140 while everything else stays on the global value.
  * ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
 
